---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Pavel Dedík - Software Engineer">
  <h1>Pavel Dedík</h1>
  <p class="status">
    <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span>Senior Software Engineer at SkipPay.cz</span>
  </p>

  <section>
    <p>
      I am currently located in Brno, Czech Republic, working as a Software Engineer.
      I mainly focus on <span class="keyword blue">Python</span> and <span class="keyword peach">Rust</span> ecosystems, but I also like to work with Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, Terraform and CI.
      My main ambition is to improve <em>developer experience</em> in products to make software engineers in companies happier.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Highlights</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><span>Building <a href="https://kukruma.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kukruma</a> - a recipe app that helps you cook more efficiently</span></li>
      <li><span>Creator of <a href="https://github.com/getludic/ludic" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ludic</a> (897★) - Type-safe HTML template engine for Python</span></li>
      <li><span>Contributed to <a href="https://github.com/django/django" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Django</a> core - Fixed PostgreSQL array field bug</span></li>
      <li><span>Former CTO at <a href="https://mergado.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mergado</a> - Led development team building e-commerce platform</span></li>
      <li><span>Maintainer of <a href="https://github.com/kiwicom/structlog-sentry" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">structlog-sentry</a> - 1.5M PyPI downloads a month</span></li>
      <li><span>Led the migration from Datadog to OpenObserve + Grafana at SkipPay.cz - saving 2,000 USD a month</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
